Roster the Yuri wall (GAFWLL) and the Allied gate (GAGATE_A).

GAFWLL is retail's temp Yuri wall (YAWALL never shipped):
Prerequisite=YABRCK, AIBasePlanningSide=2, art ggfwll.shp. Rostering
it lets the Yuri AI's ConcreteWalls pick resolve (was -1: Yuri built
no walls) and shows it on a Yuri sidebar behind its prerequisite.
GAGATE_A (TechLevel=-1, art gtgate_a.shp, 9 gate stages) is map-only:
pre-placed map gates now load as real buildings with the gate
open/close behavior instead of static dressing. Append-only roster
growth (41->43); no save-format change. Tests: synthetic AI
ConcreteWalls pick per side, real-artmd pins for both types.

